  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vinod vs State Of U.P. on 8 July, 2022 Author: Siddharth Bench: Siddharth",
    "facts": "It has been submitted that implication under Section 272 IPC is unjustified since there is a special Act holding the field, i.e. Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. False recovery has been shown against the applicant. The offence under sections 60 of Excise Act is bailable and triable by Magistrate. The applicant is in jail since 21.03.2022. On the other hand learned AGA has opposed the prayer for bail but could not dispute the above submissions.",
